   "description": "Published because: the code passes it to InternetOpenW as argument 1 (lpszAgent, the user agent the HTTP session the call opens sends): decode_string_blobs decoded it in ev_0021 (blob at file offset 0xd9e0), loaded at 0x4db0 in the function at 0x4d20 and given to the routine called at 0x4db4; the frame slot that routine was given is argument 1 of the call at 0x4ded to the function at 0x4c70, and inside that function argument 1 of the call at 0x4cb0, through the slot 0x10e00 that ev_0025 names, on the path where every conditional jump falls through; it begins as the common browsers' user agents do, but carries 'Tob 1.1', a token their own user agents do not send.",
